WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.168
A strong paragraph has four parts.

2
00:00:01.168 --> 00:00:05.148
Claim, evidence, explanation, so what. Here is one, built part by part.

3
00:00:05.148 --> 00:00:10.046
Claim: answer the question in one clear sentence.

4
00:00:10.046 --> 00:00:14.944
Evidence: a short quote or a specific detail from the text.

5
00:00:14.944 --> 00:00:18.617
Explanation: show how the evidence proves your claim.

6
00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:22.291
Name the technique, then say what it does.

7
00:00:22.291 --> 00:00:25.964
So what: link it to the writer’s purpose and the wider world.

8
00:00:25.964 --> 00:00:29.638
This is the part that lifts an answer towards Merit and Excellence.

9
00:00:29.638 --> 00:00:34.566
One idea per paragraph. All four parts, every time.

10
00:00:34.536 --> 00:00:39.934
